# `!` forms: negated operators, `in~`, and `!` followed by an ordinary name.
mode: syntax
---- query
a !has b !has_error !in~ c in~ d !contains_cs e !x
---- expected
IDENT@0..1 "a"
WHITESPACE@1..2 " "
NEGATED_OP@2..6 "!has"
WHITESPACE@6..7 " "
IDENT@7..8 "b"
WHITESPACE@8..9 " "
BANG@9..10 "!"
IDENT@10..19 "has_error"
WHITESPACE@19..20 " "
NEGATED_OP@20..24 "!in~"
WHITESPACE@24..25 " "
IDENT@25..26 "c"
WHITESPACE@26..27 " "
IN_TILDE@27..30 "in~"
WHITESPACE@30..31 " "
IDENT@31..32 "d"
WHITESPACE@32..33 " "
NEGATED_OP@33..45 "!contains_cs"
WHITESPACE@45..46 " "
IDENT@46..47 "e"
WHITESPACE@47..48 " "
BANG@48..49 "!"
IDENT@49..50 "x"
WHITESPACE@50..51 "\n"
